<title>USA: McGrath Rentcorp sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>McGrath Rentcorp sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SAN LORENZO, Calif. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>McGrath RentCorp said it has declared a two-for-one stock split of the company's common stock payable April 25 to shareholders of record on April 15, and raised the quarterly dividend to $0.08 per share after the stock split, or $0.16 per share on a pre-split basis, payable April 30 to shareholders of record on April 15.</p>
<p>The company had paid $0.14 per share pre-split quarterly.</p>
